					"content": "（絲柯克的目光望向遙遠的天際。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150380702
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150380702,
					"content": "（這裡已經沒有要做的事了，要離開嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150380703,
